### Transfer first key usage

< {%
    client.global.set("idempotencyKey", $random.uuid);
%}
POST http://localhost:8080/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

{ "fromAccountId": "{{fromAccount}}", "toAccountId": "{{toAccount}}", "amount": 100 }

### Transfer same key usage

POST http://localhost:8080/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

{ "fromAccountId": "{{fromAccount}}", "toAccountId": "{{toAccount}}", "amount": 100 }

### Deposit with first usage of the key

< {%
    client.global.set("idempotencyKeyDeposit", $random.uuid);
%}
POST http://localhost:8080/payments/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKeyDeposit}}

{"accountId": "{{CadAccount}}", "amount": "500"}

### Deposit using the same key

POST http://localhost:8080/payments/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKeyDeposit}}

{"accountId": "{{CadAccount}}", "amount": "500"}

